*"Metro Manufacturing has proven its ability to generate significant revenue ($2.4M last quarter) and maintains a secure cash position ($2.1M / 14 months runway). Our strategic focus is now shifting from pure top-line growth to operational excellence. By aggressively pursuing margin improvements and investing in scalable, efficient manufacturing processes, we are positioning the company for sustainable profitability and long-term market leadership."*

