"Metro Manufacturing is in a strong financial position with **$2.1M in cash** and a comfortable **14-month runway**, giving us the stability to strategically invest in our next phase of growth. Having achieved a solid **$2.4M in revenue last quarter**, our focus is now shifting from initial traction to sustainable, profitable scaling. By optimizing our supply chain, investing in operational efficiencies, and implementing lean manufacturing processes, we aim to significantly improve our margins. This ensures that as we scale our operations and increase output, our profitability grows at an accelerated rate, keeping our burn rate strictly managed."

